Description: OU Linux menu launcher plugin for the Xfce panel
 OU Menu is a panel-plugin launcher for the Xfce desktop. It is an
 OU Linux fork of MeowMenu, which originated as a fork of Xfce's Whisker Menu
 and keeps the familiar panel-launcher feel while bringing a cleaner
 modern look and a more capable search bar.
